'''Dread Bore''' (シノシシ ''Shinoshishi'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Bore]] found in [[Into the Future]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]] and [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

