==Trivia==
*Dread Bore's Japanese name, Shinoshishi (シノシシ), is a pun on 死 ''shi'' (death), 猪 ''inoshishi'' (wild boar) and 死屍 ''shishi'' (corpse).
*Dread Bore is noticeably smaller than most other [[Bore]]s, in spite of having similar stats. It is speculated that this was done so that the animators could use the same burrowing animation that was used for other [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie enemies]]. Without the size decrease, Dread Bore would have been too large to fit in the hole and thus would require a modified digging animation.

